{"id":2722,"date":"2025-11-10T22:20:16","date_gmt":"2025-11-10T22:20:16","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/?page_id=2722"},"modified":"2026-01-19T04:22:11","modified_gmt":"2026-01-19T04:22:11","slug":"aeronautica","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/aeronautica\/","title":{"rendered":"Aeron\u00e1utica"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"2722\" class=\"elementor elementor-2722\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-61419b31 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"61419b31\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-73888774 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"73888774\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1173203 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1173203\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f054235 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f054235\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Pre-Requisitos:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Base en ingenier\u00eda aeron\u00e1utica, mec\u00e1nica, aeroespacial o experiencia equivalente en proyectos t\u00e9cnicos.<\/li><li>Manejo pr\u00e1ctico de Python para an\u00e1lisis y visualizaci\u00f3n de datos, y disposici\u00f3n para aplicar criterio anal\u00edtico en la interpretaci\u00f3n de resultados.<\/li><li>Experiencia previa en CFD es deseable, pero no obligatoria.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-120c159 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"120c159\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"558\" src=\"https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/Oscar-Tejada-Paty-Ortiz-1024x558.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-2911\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/Oscar-Tejada-Paty-Ortiz-1024x558.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/Oscar-Tejada-Paty-Ortiz-300x164.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/Oscar-Tejada-Paty-Ortiz-768x419.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/Oscar-Tejada-Paty-Ortiz-1536x837.jpeg 1536w, https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/Oscar-Tejada-Paty-Ortiz.jpeg 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2df12ee2 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2df12ee2\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7c10ac1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7c10ac1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Aeron\u00e1utica para el futuro: Innovaci\u00f3n y Dise\u00f1o Aplicado <\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2069e45 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"2069e45\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Patricia Ortiz<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2b44d5c9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2b44d5c9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><b>Descripci\u00f3n del taller:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Este curso avanzado introduce a los participantes en los fundamentos cient\u00edficos de la ingenier\u00eda aeron\u00e1utica mediante sesiones te\u00f3ricas, pr\u00e1cticas experimentales, simulaciones computacionales y el desarrollo colaborativo de un proyecto de dise\u00f1o conceptual de aeronave. La estructura del workshop combina la comprensi\u00f3n profunda de los principios del vuelo, las configuraciones aerodin\u00e1micas, los sistemas de propulsi\u00f3n y la integraci\u00f3n de estructuras, con el uso de herramientas de an\u00e1lisis y validaci\u00f3n.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Los estudiantes trabajar\u00e1n en equipos para investigar, modelar y justificar t\u00e9cnicamente un concepto aeron\u00e1utico innovador, abordando desaf\u00edos actuales en eficiencia energ\u00e9tica, movilidad a\u00e9rea y dise\u00f1o estructural. El objetivo principal es conectar los fundamentos de la ingenier\u00eda mec\u00e1nica y aeroespacial con aplicaciones reales, fomentando el pensamiento cr\u00edtico, el uso riguroso del m\u00e9todo cient\u00edfico y la comunicaci\u00f3n t\u00e9cnica en entornos acad\u00e9micos y profesionales.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Pre-Requisitos: Base en ingenier\u00eda aeron\u00e1utica, mec\u00e1nica, aeroespacial o experiencia equivalente en proyectos t\u00e9cnicos. Manejo pr\u00e1ctico de Python para an\u00e1lisis y visualizaci\u00f3n de datos, y disposici\u00f3n para aplicar criterio anal\u00edtico en la interpretaci\u00f3n de resultados. Experiencia previa en CFD es deseable, pero no obligatoria. Aeron\u00e1utica para el futuro: Innovaci\u00f3n y Dise\u00f1o Aplicado Patricia Ortiz Descripci\u00f3n del [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-2722","page","type-page","status-publish"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/2722","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=2722"}],"version-history":[{"count":34,"href":"https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/2722\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":3150,"href":"https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/2722\/revisions\/3150"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/inspirastem.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=2722"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}